# Shardmage's Rescue (flash): "as long as this Aura entered this turn, enchanted creature has hexproof", and +1/+1.
# Cast in response to Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 2, it makes Llanowar Elves hexproof so the Bolt has no legal target and
# fizzles; by turn 3 the Aura did not enter this turn, the hexproof is gone and only the +1/+1 is left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Llanowar Elves
Shardmage's Rescue
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x5
Mountain x10

